# An X session on Dolly's display: the Xsdl server, twm managing the
# windows, and three of X's own clients in theirs: a clock, eyes that follow
# the pointer and a terminal with a shell, where imgui-x11 starts Dear ImGui's
# example in a window of its own.
FROM /v0.1.4/Dollyfile-system e2416f7734ba0e15eb5c6c917ae5c43b4a015cd4867cf1727b3238690884dd10
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xorg-server 9b1f1fbda565444b949abc7b73f6ee01bce178ef903913b7ec1693107427e6d6
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-twm 3e4920ba3fa7de0474ef8958993f1620321d4a29cd7c532566d51fe94f6498ef
